USER GOAL
Create a social media post that explains the value and necessity of forecasting marketing performance before launching new campaigns.

TOPIC
The strategic importance of pre-campaign forecasting and performance modeling. It focuses on the shift from reactive decision-making to predictive, data-driven planning.

AUDIENCE
Modern growth teams, Marketing Directors, and CMOs managing significant annual marketing budgets ($10M+) who need to justify spend and improve ROI. [DNA: Target Audience]

KEY MESSAGE
Predicting campaign outcomes before launch transforms marketing from a cost center into a measurable, optimized revenue engine.

ANGLE
